---
<div class="bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[3px] p-6">
	<dl class="flex flex-col gap-4">
		<div>
			<dt class="eyebrow text-muted mb-1">Pattern</dt>
			<dd class="text-ink font-medium">The Interrogator</dd>
		</div>
		<div>
			<dt class="eyebrow text-muted mb-1">Cue</dt>
			<dd class="text-ink">Any message that lands as a slight, after 3 p.m.</dd>
		</div>
		<div>
			<dt class="eyebrow text-muted mb-1">The rep</dt>
			<dd class="text-ink">
				Write the reply in full. Don't send it. Reread at 9 a.m. and send whatever still
				holds up.
			</dd>
		</div>
		<div>
			<dt class="eyebrow text-muted mb-1">What it disputes</dt>
			<dd class="text-ink">"If I don't respond now, they'll read it as weakness."</dd>
		</div>
		<div>
			<dt class="eyebrow text-muted mb-1">Anchor</dt>
			<dd class="pull-quote text-ink">
				"Men are disturbed not by things, but by the views which they take of them." —
				Epictetus
			</dd>
		</div>
		<div>
			<dt class="eyebrow text-muted mb-1">Evidence</dt>
			<dd class="text-ink">
				Rater item: "When I raise a problem, I can predict how they'll react."
			</dd>
		</div>
	</dl>
</div>
